WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:10.810
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.970
Haven't you gotten fat lately?

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.970
T-T-T-That's not true. You're rude.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:16.060
Kashino is right. You ate too many of your failed creations.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.820
closed captions

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:20.070
Hey, hey. Both you and Kashino. You both are being rude towards a lady, aren't you?

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:22.500
Besides, she isn't fat. She's only gone up 2 kg.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.790
You promised not to tell anyone...

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:27.500
Ah, sorry.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.190
Same goes for you too.

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:32.380
Vanilla doesn't matter in this.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.360
And you, Caramel, from the start. Aren't you round and fat?

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:34.500
Well, well.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.040
We'd think it's good timing instead.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.040
Of course not.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.320
You're really angry, aren't you?

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.100
Hanabusa-kun!

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:41.040
It feels like a marshmallow.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.630
Of course, you're an animal!

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.480
I'm lost in the conversation...

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:43.480
Shut up!

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.380
Exactly!

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.200
It's Ichigo.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.570
Ah, Rumi-san.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:55.570
The lineup for the quarterfinals of Cake Grand Prix have been posted.

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:55.570
Team Narita - Team Koshiro    Team Lemon - Team Ichigo         Team Kobayakawa - Team Ooba        Team Yoshida - Team Nemoto

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:57.360
Team Lemon?

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.110
It's the only first-year group who won.

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:02.210
Oh? Is that so?

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:05.000
You're really lucky that you're going against them, this will be easy.

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:09.660
But, they are still the best team from the first year.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:11.800
I wonder what kind of team they are?

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:13.170
Does that bother you?

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:14.420
Yeah.

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:18.800
Whether the opponent is a first year or a third year is irrelevant.

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:21.620
Anyway, all we need to do is to win.

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:25.480
Rather than worrying about your opponents, worry about your own clumsiness!

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:28.650
Makoto-kyuuuun~

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:34.410
Ojou-sama!

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:35.530
Are you hurt?

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:36.860
Dar-ling!

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:40.330
Don't lean against me; Don't touch me; Don't ride on me.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:45.680
Geez Makoto-kun, we haven't gotten married yet, and now you want me to help you fix your tie.

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:50.330
You need to tie this up properly, dar-ling.

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:55.340
Geez, you really like to cause trouble.

